{"seq":4,"slug":"monad-transformers","title":"Monad Transformer 单子变换器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/functors-and-monads/monad-transformers","wordCount":906,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"monad-transformer-单子变换器\">Monad Transformer 单子变换器</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Monad <strong>不天然可组合</strong>：当程序同时需要失败（Either）与环境（Reader）与 I/O 时，<code>IO (Maybe a)</code> 这样的嵌套会让每一步都要手动拆包。<strong>Monad Transformer</strong> 接受一个 Monad 作为参数，返回一个同时具备两种效果的新 Monad，把拆包逻辑封装进 <code>flatMap</code>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Transformer</td>\n<td>接受 Monad 返回新 Monad 的类型构造器</td>\n<td>叠加两种效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常见实例</td>\n<td>MaybeT / EitherT / ReaderT / StateT / WriterT</td>\n<td>对应各类上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>lift</td>\n<td>把底层 Monad 操作提升到 Transformer 层</td>\n<td>在叠加栈中调用底层能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Transformer 栈</td>\n<td>多层叠加，如 <code>ReaderT Config (EitherT Error IO)</code></td>\n<td>组合多种效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>替代方案</td>\n<td>Free Monad、Effect System、Effect-TS</td>\n<td>规避性能开销与 lift 噪音</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Transformer 是解决&quot;多效果组合&quot;的经典方案，但栈越深、lift 越吵。Effect System 用单一类型统一处理效果，是更现代的方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"效果组合问题\">效果组合问题</h2><p>真实程序通常需要同时处理多种效果：一个函数可能<strong>既会失败</strong>（Either），<strong>又需要读取配置</strong>（Reader），<strong>还涉及 I/O</strong>（IO）。但 Monad 不天然可组合——你无法简单地将两个 Monad &quot;叠加&quot;在一起。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- 我们需要同时处理 IO 和 Maybe&#10;-- 但 IO (Maybe a) 的嵌套操作很笨拙&#10;lookupUser :: String -&gt; IO (Maybe User)&#10;lookupAddress :: User -&gt; IO (Maybe Address)&#10;&#10;getUserCity :: String -&gt; IO (Maybe String)&#10;getUserCity name = do&#10;  mUser &lt;- lookupUser name&#10;  case mUser of&#10;    Nothing -&gt; return Nothing&#10;    Just user -&gt; do&#10;      mAddr &lt;- lookupAddress user&#10;      case mAddr of&#10;        Nothing -&gt; return Nothing&#10;        Just addr -&gt; return (Just (city addr))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 我们需要同时处理 IO 和 Maybe</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 但 IO (Maybe a) 的嵌套操作很笨拙</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lookupUser :: String -> IO (Maybe User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lookupAddress :: User -> IO (Maybe Address)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>getUserCity :: String -> IO (Maybe String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>getUserCity name = do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  mUser &#x3C;- lookupUser name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  case mUser of</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Nothing -> return Nothing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Just user -> do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      mAddr &#x3C;- lookupAddress user</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      case mAddr of</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Nothing -> return Nothing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Just addr -> return (Just (city addr))</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type IO&lt;A&gt; = { run: () =&gt; A };&#10;type Option&lt;A&gt; = { tag: &#39;none&#39; } | { tag: &#39;some&#39;; value: A };&#10;&#10;const getUserCity = (name: string): IO&lt;Option&lt;string&gt;&gt; =&gt; ({&#10;  run: () =&gt; {&#10;    const mUser = lookupUser(name).run();&#10;    if (mUser.tag === &#39;none&#39;) return mUser;&#10;    const mAddr = lookupAddress(mUser.value).run();&#10;    if (mAddr.tag === &#39;none&#39;) return mAddr;&#10;    return { tag: &#39;some&#39;, value: mAddr.value.city };&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'none'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'some'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getUserCity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mUser</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lookupUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (mUser.tag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'none'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mUser;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mAddr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lookupAddress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mUser.value).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (mAddr.tag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'none'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mAddr;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { tag: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'some'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: mAddr.value.city };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>效果组合需求</th>\n<th>嵌套方式</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>IO + Maybe</td>\n<td><code>IO (Maybe a)</code></td>\n<td>需要手动拆包 Maybe</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IO + Either</td>\n<td><code>IO (Either e a)</code></td>\n<td>需要 case 匹配每一步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reader + Either</td>\n<td><code>Reader r (Either e a)</code></td>\n<td>环境传递 + 错误处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IO + Reader + Either</td>\n<td>三层嵌套</td>\n<td>完全不可维护</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;无 Transformer&quot;&#10;        A[&quot;IO (Maybe a)&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;手动拆包&quot;| B[&quot;case 匹配&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt;|&quot;Just&quot;| C[&quot;继续&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt;|&quot;Nothing&quot;| D[&quot;return Nothing&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;有 Transformer&quot;&#10;        E[&quot;MaybeT IO a&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;flatMap&quot;| F[&quot;自动处理 Nothing&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"无 Transformer\"\n        A[\"IO (Maybe a)\"] --&gt;|\"手动拆包\"| B[\"case 匹配\"]\n        B --&gt;|\"Just\"| C[\"继续\"]\n        B --&gt;|\"Nothing\"| D[\"return Nothing\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"有 Transformer\"\n        E[\"MaybeT IO a\"] --&gt;|\"flatMap\"| F[\"自动处理 Nothing\"]\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Monad 不可组合是函数式编程中的核心困难之一。给定 Monad M 和 Monad N，<code>M (N a)</code> 不一定是 Monad。Monad Transformer 是解决这个问题的经典方案。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"monad-transformer-概念\">Monad Transformer 概念</h2><p><strong>Monad Transformer</strong> 是一个类型构造器，它接受一个 Monad 作为参数，返回一个新的 Monad，这个新 Monad 同时具有两种效果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"newtype MaybeT m a = MaybeT { runMaybeT :: m (Maybe a) }&#10;&#10;instance Monad m =&gt; Monad (MaybeT m) where&#10;  return = MaybeT . return . Just&#10;  (MaybeT mma) &gt;&gt;= f = MaybeT $ do&#10;    ma &lt;- mma&#10;    case ma of&#10;      Nothing -&gt; return Nothing&#10;      Just a  -&gt; runMaybeT (f a)&#10;&#10;getUserCity :: String -&gt; MaybeT IO String&#10;getUserCity name = do&#10;  user &lt;- MaybeT (lookupUser name)&#10;  addr &lt;- MaybeT (lookupAddress user)&#10;  return (city addr)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>newtype MaybeT m a = MaybeT { runMaybeT :: m (Maybe a) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>instance Monad m => Monad (MaybeT m) where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return = MaybeT . return . Just</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (MaybeT mma) >>= f = MaybeT $ do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ma &#x3C;- mma</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    case ma of</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      Nothing -> return Nothing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      Just a  -> runMaybeT (f a)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>getUserCity :: String -> MaybeT IO String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>getUserCity name = do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  user &#x3C;- MaybeT (lookupUser name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  addr &#x3C;- MaybeT (lookupAddress user)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (city addr)</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type MaybeT&lt;M, A&gt; = { value: M };&#10;&#10;const maybeTBind = &lt;A, B&gt;(mma: IO&lt;Option&lt;A&gt;&gt;, f: (a: A) =&gt; IO&lt;Option&lt;B&gt;&gt;): IO&lt;Option&lt;B&gt;&gt; =&gt; ({&#10;  run: () =&gt; {&#10;    const ma = mma.run();&#10;    if (ma.tag === &#39;none&#39;) return ma;&#10;    return f(ma.value).run();&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MaybeT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">M</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> M</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> maybeTBind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mma</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>>, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ma</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mma.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ma.tag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'none'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ma;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ma.value).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Transformer</th>\n<th>基础 Monad</th>\n<th>结果类型</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MaybeT</td>\n<td>Maybe</td>\n<td><code>MaybeT m a</code></td>\n<td>m + 可能缺失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EitherT</td>\n<td>Either</td>\n<td><code>EitherT e m a</code></td>\n<td>m + 可能出错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ReaderT</td>\n<td>Reader</td>\n<td><code>ReaderT r m a</code></td>\n<td>m + 环境读取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>StateT</td>\n<td>State</td>\n<td><code>StateT s m a</code></td>\n<td>m + 状态读写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WriterT</td>\n<td>Writer</td>\n<td><code>WriterT w m a</code></td>\n<td>m + 日志累积</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    BASE[&quot;基础 Monad M&quot;] --&gt; WRAP[&quot;Transformer T&quot;]&#10;    WRAP --&gt; COMBINED[&quot;T M - 组合 Monad&quot;]&#10;    IO[&quot;IO&quot;] --&gt; MAYT[&quot;MaybeT&quot;]&#10;    MAYT --&gt; RESULT[&quot;MaybeT IO&lt;br/&gt;= IO + Maybe&quot;]\">graph TD\n    BASE[\"基础 Monad M\"] --&gt; WRAP[\"Transformer T\"]\n    WRAP --&gt; COMBINED[\"T M - 组合 Monad\"]\n    IO[\"IO\"] --&gt; MAYT[\"MaybeT\"]\n    MAYT --&gt; RESULT[\"MaybeT IO&lt;br/&gt;= IO + Maybe\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"lift-操作\">lift 操作</h2><p><strong>lift</strong> 将底层 Monad 的操作提升到 Transformer 层级：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"class MonadTrans t where&#10;  lift :: Monad m =&gt; m a -&gt; t m a&#10;&#10;instance MonadTrans MaybeT where&#10;  lift ma = MaybeT (fmap Just ma)&#10;&#10;example :: MaybeT IO ()&#10;example = do&#10;  lift (putStrLn &quot;Starting...&quot;)&#10;  user &lt;- MaybeT (lookupUser &quot;alice&quot;)&#10;  lift (putStrLn $ &quot;Found: &quot; ++ userName user)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class MonadTrans t where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  lift :: Monad m => m a -> t m a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>instance MonadTrans MaybeT where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  lift ma = MaybeT (fmap Just ma)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>example :: MaybeT IO ()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>example = do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  lift (putStrLn \"Starting...\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  user &#x3C;- MaybeT (lookupUser \"alice\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  lift (putStrLn $ \"Found: \" ++ userName user)</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const liftIO = &lt;A&gt;(io: IO&lt;A&gt;): IO&lt;Option&lt;A&gt;&gt; =&gt; ({&#10;  run: () =&gt; ({ tag: &#39;some&#39; as const, value: io.run() }),&#10;});&#10;&#10;const liftOption = &lt;A&gt;(opt: Option&lt;A&gt;): IO&lt;Option&lt;A&gt;&gt; =&gt; ({&#10;  run: () =&gt; opt,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> liftIO</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">io</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ tag: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'some'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: io.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> liftOption</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">opt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>类型签名</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>lift</td>\n<td><code>m a → t m a</code></td>\n<td>提升底层操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>liftIO</td>\n<td><code>IO a → t IO a</code></td>\n<td>提升 IO 操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hoist</td>\n<td><code>m a → n a</code> 的自然变换</td>\n<td>变换底层 Monad</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>run</td>\n<td><code>t m a → m (inner a)</code></td>\n<td>解包运行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> lift 的直觉：当你在 <code>MaybeT IO</code> 的 do 块中想直接使用一个 <code>IO</code> 操作（如 putStrLn），你需要 lift 把它从 IO 层提升到 MaybeT IO 层。就像坐电梯上楼一样。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"transformer-栈\">Transformer 栈</h2><p>多个 Transformer 可以层叠形成&quot;Transformer 栈&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"type App = ReaderT Config (EitherT AppError IO)&#10;&#10;runApp :: Config -&gt; App a -&gt; IO (Either AppError a)&#10;runApp config app = runEitherT (runReaderT app config)&#10;&#10;getUser :: String -&gt; App User&#10;getUser name = do&#10;  config &lt;- ask&#10;  result &lt;- lift . lift $ httpGet (apiUrl config ++ &quot;/users/&quot; ++ name)&#10;  case parseUser result of&#10;    Left err -&gt; lift (throwError (ParseError err))&#10;    Right user -&gt; return user\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type App = ReaderT Config (EitherT AppError IO)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>runApp :: Config -> App a -> IO (Either AppError a)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>runApp config app = runEitherT (runReaderT app config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>getUser :: String -> App User</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>getUser name = do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  config &#x3C;- ask</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  result &#x3C;- lift . lift $ httpGet (apiUrl config ++ \"/users/\" ++ name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  case parseUser result of</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Left err -> lift (throwError (ParseError err))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Right user -> return user</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph BT&#10;    IO[&quot;IO - 底层&quot;] --&gt; EITHERT[&quot;EitherT AppError - 错误处理&quot;]&#10;    EITHERT --&gt; READERT[&quot;ReaderT Config - 配置注入&quot;]&#10;    READERT --&gt; APP[&quot;App Monad - 应用层&quot;]\">graph BT\n    IO[\"IO - 底层\"] --&gt; EITHERT[\"EitherT AppError - 错误处理\"]\n    EITHERT --&gt; READERT[\"ReaderT Config - 配置注入\"]\n    READERT --&gt; APP[\"App Monad - 应用层\"]</pre><p>常见的 Transformer 栈配置：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>栈配置</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>ReaderT Config IO</code></td>\n<td>配置 + IO</td>\n<td>服务端应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>EitherT Error IO</code></td>\n<td>错误处理 + IO</td>\n<td>CLI 工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ReaderT r (EitherT e IO)</code></td>\n<td>配置 + 错误 + IO</td>\n<td>Web 服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>StateT s (EitherT e IO)</code></td>\n<td>状态 + 错误 + IO</td>\n<td>有状态处理器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WriterT Log (ReaderT r IO)</code></td>\n<td>日志 + 配置 + IO</td>\n<td>带审计的服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"替代方案\">替代方案</h2><p>Monad Transformer 虽然经典，但存在性能开销和 lift 噪音等问题，业界已发展出多种替代方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- Free Monad&#10;data Free f a = Pure a | Free (f (Free f a))&#10;&#10;-- Effect System (示例：Polysemy)&#10;-- type MyEffect = &#39;[Reader Config, Error AppError, Embed IO]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- Free Monad</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data Free f a = Pure a | Free (f (Free f a))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- Effect System (示例：Polysemy)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- type MyEffect = '[Reader Config, Error AppError, Embed IO]</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Effect-TS 的 Effect 类型&#10;// type Effect&lt;R, E, A&gt; = (requirements: R) =&gt; Either&lt;E, A&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Effect-TS 的 Effect 类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// type Effect&#x3C;R, E, A> = (requirements: R) => Either&#x3C;E, A></span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>可扩展性</th>\n<th>代表库/语言</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Monad Transformer</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>⚠️ 开销</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>mtl (Haskell)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Free Monad</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>⚠️ 开销</td>\n<td>✅ 高</td>\n<td>free (Haskell)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Effect System</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>✅ 好</td>\n<td>✅ 高</td>\n<td>Polysemy, ZIO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Effect-TS</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>✅ 好</td>\n<td>✅ 高</td>\n<td>Effect (TS)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直接风格</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>✅ 好</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>手动组合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 TypeScript 生态中，Effect-TS 库提供了类似 Scala ZIO 的 Effect 系统，用 <code>Effect&lt;Requirements, Error, Value&gt;</code> 三个类型参数统一处理所有效果，避免了 Transformer 栈的复杂性。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Monad Transformer))&#10;    问题&#10;      Monad 不可组合&#10;      嵌套拆包繁琐&#10;      多效果需求&#10;    概念&#10;      接受 Monad 返回 Monad&#10;      MaybeT / EitherT&#10;      ReaderT / StateT&#10;    lift&#10;      提升底层操作&#10;      逐层提升&#10;      liftIO&#10;    Transformer 栈&#10;      多层叠加&#10;      ReaderT + EitherT + IO&#10;      性能开销&#10;    替代方案&#10;      Free Monad&#10;      Effect System&#10;      Effect-TS\">mindmap\n  root((Monad Transformer))\n    问题\n      Monad 不可组合\n      嵌套拆包繁琐\n      多效果需求\n    概念\n      接受 Monad 返回 Monad\n      MaybeT / EitherT\n      ReaderT / StateT\n    lift\n      提升底层操作\n      逐层提升\n      liftIO\n    Transformer 栈\n      多层叠加\n      ReaderT + EitherT + IO\n      性能开销\n    替代方案\n      Free Monad\n      Effect System\n      Effect-TS</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Monad 不天然可组合</strong>，Monad Transformer 通过类型构造器叠加实现多效果组合。</li>\n<li><strong>lift</strong> 将底层 Monad 操作提升到 Transformer 层级，是 Transformer 栈中的关键操作。</li>\n<li>常见 Transformer 包括 MaybeT、EitherT、ReaderT、StateT、WriterT。</li>\n<li>Transformer 栈存在性能开销和 lift 噪音，<strong>Effect System</strong> 是更现代的替代方案。</li>\n<li>TypeScript 生态中 <strong>Effect-TS</strong> 提供了统一的效果处理方式，避免了 Transformer 的复杂性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Monad Transformer 单子变换器","id":"monad-transformer-单子变换器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"效果组合问题","id":"效果组合问题"},{"level":2,"text":"Monad Transformer 概念","id":"monad-transformer-概念"},{"level":2,"text":"lift 操作","id":"lift-操作"},{"level":2,"text":"Transformer 栈","id":"transformer-栈"},{"level":2,"text":"替代方案","id":"替代方案"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"常见 Monad","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/functors-and-monads/common-monads"},"next":{"title":"TypeScript 中的 FP","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/fp-in-practice/fp-in-typescript"}}